#, c-sharp-format
msgid "{0} (your pack)"
msgstr "{0} (sizning to'plamingiz)"

msgid "That pack has mistakes, so it isn't used:"
msgstr "Bu to'plamda xatolar bor, shuning uchun ishlatilmaydi:"

